## Records

::bg{location="records" time="night"}
@narrator: Filing cabinets to the ceiling. Every drawer has been pulled out and put back in the wrong cabinet, as if someone had been looking for one name for forty years.
@narrator: On the table, open under a green-shaded lamp that has no bulb: the admissions ledger. Three pages have been torn out.
@nell{mono}: Admissions, 1961 to 1979. Name, bed, date. Discharged, never.
<match on="@lateNight">
  <when is="true">
    @narrator: The last line on the open page is wet. ARDEN, T. Bed 13. The ink is today's.
    ::fright{amount=2}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator: The last line on the open page is blank, ruled, and waiting.
  </otherwise>
</match>
